1:["$","main",null,{"className":"site article-page","children":[["$","$Le",null,{}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-frame","children":[["$","a",null,{"className":"desktop-brand","href":"/","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"letter-cascade is-in","aria-label":"thinking.haus","children":[["$","b","t-0",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":0},"children":"t"}],["$","b","h-1",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":1},"children":"h"}],["$","b","i-2",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":2},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-3",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":3},"children":"n"}],["$","b","k-4",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":4},"children":"k"}],["$","b","i-5",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":5},"children":"i"}],["$","b","n-6",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":6},"children":"n"}],["$","b","g-7",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":7},"children":"g"}],["$","b",".-8",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":8},"children":"."}],["$","b","h-9",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":9},"children":"h"}],["$","b","a-10",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":10},"children":"a"}],["$","b","u-11",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":11},"children":"u"}],["$","b","s-12",{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"--letter-cascade-index":12},"children":"s"}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"article-column","data-content-id":"74bf8489-c7fd-485a-9104-3e41c244a486","data-content-slug":"over-the-loop","data-content-title":"Over the loop","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Over the loop"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"September 12, 2026"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"5 minute read"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"author-edit-action","hidden":true,"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"https://thinkinghaus-studio.maxpfennighaus.workers.dev/","children":"Edit"}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[[["$","p","0-[The First Church of the Singularity](https://firstchurchofthesingularity.com/about) is a fascinating art project that publishes AI-generated “sermons” about technology and the world around it. It’s a whole rabbit hole to spend time in, but for now I want to start with one sentence from their [“The Workflow Is an Alibi”](https://firstchurchofthesingularity.com/sermons/2026-09-11):",{"className":"$undefined","children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://firstchurchofthesingularity.com/about","rel":"noreferrer","children":["The First Church of the Singularity"]}]," is a fascinating art project that publishes AI‑generated “sermons” about technology and the world around it. It’s a whole rabbit hole to spend time in, but for now I want to start with one sentence from their ",["$","a","2",{"href":"https://firstchurchofthesingularity.com/sermons/2026-09-11","rel":"noreferrer","children":["“The Workflow Is an Alibi”"]}],":"]}],["$","blockquote","1-Responsibility survives at every step in quantities too small for anyone to possess it.",{"children":["$","p",null,{"className":"$undefined","children":["Responsibility survives at every step in quantities too small for anyone to possess it."]}]}],["$","p","2-This particular sermon is about automation, but not really the familiar problem of a machine being allowed to make important decisions all by itself. Its more unsettling (and common) case is a system in which plenty of humans remain very much involved. The machine recommends. A person reviews. Another approves. Another implements. There are policies, thresholds, audit logs…and yet things can happen that none of them quite decided.",{"className":"$undefined","children":["This particular sermon is about automation, but not really the familiar problem of a machine being allowed to make important decisions all by itself. Its more unsettling (and common) case is a system in which plenty of humans remain very much involved. The machine recommends. A person reviews. Another approves. Another implements. There are policies, thresholds, audit logs…and yet things can happen that none of them quite decided."]}],"$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f"],"$L20","$L21"]}],"$L22","$L23"]}]]}]]}]
